# MerchantStoreApi — requests travel through both gateways.

### canonical public store read
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/store?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Accept: application/json

### compatibility public store read
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/store/{{STORE_ID}}?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Accept: application/json

### compatibility path cannot select another tenant — 400
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/store/{{STORE_ID_2}}?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Accept: application/problem+json

### private store read
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/private/store?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{ORG_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}
Accept: application/json

### supported languages
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/store/languages?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Accept: application/json

### update store
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/private/store?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{ORG_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{STORE_ID}}",
  "name": "Riyadh Fashion Hub",
  "org": "{{ORG_ID}}",
  "email": "info@riyadhfashion.sa",
  "phone": "+966501234567",
  "theme": "BASIS",
  "colorTheme": "LIGHT",
  "currency": "SAR",
  "defaultLanguage": "ar",
  "supportedLanguages": ["ar", "en"]
}

### delete another store is permission-gated — 403
DELETE {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/private/store?store={{STORE_ID_2}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{ORG_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}

###
